0:00:00.640,0:00:05.760
So this is the Purple Wood Grass. Let's dig it up quickly.

0:00:06.359,0:00:09.359
We're screwed.

0:00:11.200,0:00:12.980
This is the Tang Clan's famed blade!

0:00:14.520,0:00:16.520
You sluggish beast!

0:00:18.060,0:00:20.700
I'll finish you in one strike!

0:00:23.039,0:00:25.200
Tang Gunak, you cheating bastard!

0:00:25.200,0:00:27.480
Not that I expect you to understand human speech,

0:00:27.480,0:00:30.120
but could we fight fair and let me swap swords?

0:00:31.660,0:00:35.000
Of course talking won't work.
No, seriously, does this even make sense?!

0:00:35.000,0:00:39.140
Swordsmanship or whatever, the blade has to cut first!

0:00:46.000,0:00:50.600
Don't tell me he's dead?!

0:00:50.920,0:00:55.840
That goddamn snake! I swear,
no matter what it takes, I'm making snake soup today!

0:00:55.840,0:00:57.640
With what, when the sword won't even pierce it?

0:00:57.640,0:01:00.719
If it doesn't work, I'll make it work!
Nothing is impossible in this world!

0:01:00.719,0:01:02.020
Wipe your nosebleed first.

0:01:03.500,0:01:05.280
Got it, let's head back for now.

0:01:05.280,0:01:07.259
If my internal energy is lacking, I just need to increase it.

0:01:07.259,0:01:08.439
Don't come in!

0:01:08.439,0:01:12.260
- What could he be thinking?
- I have no idea. He seems up to something, but...

0:01:12.260,0:01:14.060
What is this punk trying to do again?

0:01:14.700,0:01:16.700
I can't just spend thirty years training.

0:01:17.560,0:01:22.119
Thirty years? No way.
Who can wait thirty years?!

0:01:22.119,0:01:27.040
In the end, it's about internal energy.
I need internal energy right now.

0:01:27.040,0:01:29.860
I knew this day would come eventually.

0:01:31.120,0:01:32.260
Mi... In... Roo...?

0:01:32.260,0:01:37.439
Daoist elder brother, do you know what the greatest elixir under heaven is?

0:01:37.439,0:01:39.880
Elixir or whatever, it's obviously the greatest spirit pill.

0:01:39.880,0:01:45.160
- Completely wrong! The real elixir of our clan is this very poison!
- Poison is an elixir? You haven't been beaten enough lately, have you?

0:01:45.160,0:01:47.079
- Ah, brother, hear me out! Poison is a mass of raw internal energy!

0:01:47.079,0:01:49.560
If only it can be purified, it's the greatest elixir in the world!

0:01:49.560,0:01:52.719
- Smells like a quack. So, what happened to those who drank it?

0:01:52.719,0:01:53.939
Well, they all died.

0:01:53.939,0:01:55.599
You little bastard!

0:01:55.599,0:01:57.719
Whoa, brother! Don't put internal energy into that punch!

0:01:57.719,0:02:02.920
But the effect... the effect was certain!
Never drink it. Though it's the best if purified...

0:02:02.920,0:02:04.620
"If only it could be purified"...?

0:02:04.620,0:02:08.640
Drink it, and your whole body melts as you vomit blood and die, huh.

0:02:08.640,0:02:14.160
But if it can be purified,
it makes you a hundred times stronger than any spirit pill.

0:02:14.160,0:02:16.620
Who has time to wait thirty years? Did you think I couldn't do it?

0:02:16.620,0:02:20.760
The Thousand Poison Pill to raise poison resistance, and one Primordial Chaos Pill.

0:02:22.239,0:02:23.920
This should be enough, shouldn't it?

0:02:23.920,0:02:26.320
Bah, since when did I become so cowardly?

0:02:30.000,0:02:34.519
Huh? Nothing's happening..?
The internal energy in the Tears of the Beauty is monstrous, but

0:02:34.519,0:02:40.120
most of it is impure energy loaded with lethal venom.
Yet with this immense amount of power,

0:02:40.120,0:02:46.360
even if I extract just one fraction of it...
Screw it! All or nothing!

0:02:46.360,0:02:51.900
What the hell is this?! My body is about to burst and kill me!
The only place the poison hasn't reached is my Dantian!

0:02:51.900,0:02:55.560
If even this falls, it's over!
Remember, I'm not expelling it!

0:02:55.560,0:03:00.000
I purify and absorb it!
Let's see who wins, you or me!

0:03:00.000,0:03:03.799
- Stop stalling and go check on him quickly.
- Why are you picking on only me?!

0:03:03.799,0:03:07.399
He said not to come in; he didn't say not to look.

0:03:11.579,0:03:13.659
RUN FOR YOUR LIVES~~~~!!

0:03:17.480,0:03:24.760
You crazy bastard!
Please, live like a normal person, with common sense!

0:03:27.640,0:03:31.680
You punk, how on earth
can not a single day pass quietly with you?!

0:03:31.680,0:03:34.759
Let's go now, to hunt that snake.

0:03:34.759,0:03:38.519
Put some clothes on! Your senior sister is watching!

0:03:38.519,0:03:42.080
Wrap yourself up! It's unsightly!

0:03:42.360,0:03:45.400
Palace Lord! Those outsiders destroyed the residence!

0:03:45.400,0:03:50.760
Silence!
He achieved Minor Mastery; the least you could do is congratulate him!

0:03:50.760,0:03:55.400
Yes! We must share a drink to celebrate achieving Minor Mastery!

0:03:55.400,0:04:00.720
Forget the feast, let's catch the snake first. Let's have that drink with snake soup as our side dish!

0:04:03.000,0:04:06.840
Are you really fighting it again?
Your sword is broken, what on earth are you planning to do?!

0:04:06.840,0:04:10.779
Doesn't matter. It's just a beast after all,

0:04:10.779,0:04:16.359
if I beat the crap out of it, it dies all the same. COME OUT!

0:04:16.359,0:04:21.399
If Cheongmyeong cannot hold his ground,
we must charge in and save him at all costs.

0:04:24.399,0:04:26.080
You bastard!

0:04:26.460,0:04:28.500
It's working... his blows are landing!

0:04:28.500,0:04:30.459
Stay still, you beast!

0:04:31.939,0:04:33.939
Not that way! The Purple Wood Grass is over there!

0:04:33.939,0:04:36.920
I said NOT THAT WAY, you bastard!

0:04:38.720,0:04:42.660
Pissed off, are you?
You should have checked who you were messing with!

0:04:50.000,0:04:52.005
Won't he really die like this?!

0:04:52.625,0:04:57.560
Power against power, hardness against hardness...
A single petal is frail, but

0:04:57.560,0:05:01.239
gather countless petals, and they can block the flow of a mighty river!

0:05:01.239,0:05:03.899
Twenty-Four Plum Blossom Sword Technique—

0:05:03.899,0:05:05.560
Falling Plum Severing the River!

0:05:08.080,0:05:11.180
Still not perfect. The power is crude.

0:05:11.180,0:05:13.760
He won! That crazy bastard actually pulled it off!

0:05:13.760,0:05:16.860
Now, let's finish this! Come at me!

0:05:16.860,0:05:20.360
Hey! Where the hell do you think you're running, you bastard?!
You have to cough up the Inner Core first!!!

0:05:21.160,0:05:24.840
We dug them all up! Take them with the soil!
Let's run before that snake comes back!

0:05:26.400,0:05:31.600
- Huh? A... a wall?
- Hand over that sack of spiritual herbs.

0:05:33.560,0:05:40.240
- Huh? Why... why do you want it?
- If I intended to rob you, would I speak this politely?

0:05:40.240,0:05:45.720
You have to leave some behind for them to keep growing! What if you pluck them all?
I will send them steadily to Mount Hua.

0:05:45.720,0:05:48.600
Take only what you need.

0:05:48.600,0:05:51.660
We shall engrave the Palace Lord's gracious will deeply in our hearts!

0:05:51.660,0:05:54.660
The core... hand over the Inner Core!

0:06:02.562,0:06:06.060
Wow...
I thought I was going to suffocate to death.

0:06:07.720,0:06:11.919
- Did you find the Inner Core?
- Nope! Damn it, all that trouble for nothing, damn it!

0:06:11.919,0:06:15.440
- A snake that huge had no core?
- I said there wasn't one! You really never believe a word I say!

0:06:15.440,0:06:18.440
Hurry up.
I'm sick of looking at this place, so let's go!

0:06:21.700,0:06:24.600
Sleep well. Don't harm people...

0:06:25.320,0:06:27.400
Senior sister, aren't you coming?

0:06:28.200,0:06:29.639
I'm coming.

0:06:30.239,0:06:33.179
Let's go, to Mount Hua!

0:06:54.039,0:07:01.599
A hundred years have passed, and opening my eyes again,
the once-proud name lies asleep beneath the dust.

0:07:01.599,0:07:11.560
Unfamiliar faces, amidst unfamiliar scenery...
Yet this wind still remembers.

0:07:11.720,0:07:17.120
Even if the flowers have fallen once,
it is not yet the end.

0:07:17.120,0:07:23.140
Plum blossoms bloom, riding across the barren peaks,
the forgotten name,

0:07:23.140,0:07:28.120
breathes again,
we still remain here.

0:07:28.120,0:07:33.039
After a hundred years,
it is Mount Hua once more.

0:07:34.280,0:07:39.919
Holding the broken blade, I take another step forward.
Even rusted years cannot stop me.

0:07:39.919,0:07:44.360
An unkept promise,
held close within my heart,

0:07:44.360,0:07:51.680
along this blood-stained path,
I run forward once again.

0:07:52.120,0:07:55.919
Even if the flowers have fallen once,
it is not yet the end.

0:07:57.560,0:08:02.879
Plum blossoms bloom, riding across the barren peaks,
the forgotten name,

0:08:02.879,0:08:09.319
breathes again,
we still remain here.

0:08:09.319,0:08:12.319
After a hundred years,
it is Mount Hua once more.

0:08:23.580,0:08:29.540
Even on a winding, twisted path,
the end leads back to the mountains.

0:08:29.540,0:08:34.758
Plum blossoms bloom, spreading along the sword's edge,
the buried name,

0:08:34.758,0:08:41.078
blooms once again.
Beyond a hundred years, it is Mount Hua once more!
